https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CZ8K1sRibCY  (Capo 0)

TIP:  The song sharps midway through.  To sing along with the video capo the 1st fret where indicated.  

TIP:  In the intro, (D6) is just (D) without the ring finger.  If you find it difficult to get a clean sound try forming up the (D) with the middle and ring fingers in the 2nd fret and your pinky on the 2nd string/3rd fret.  For some reason you may get more separation over the B string using the pinky instead of the ring finger.  Hold through the first line of the song and then play (D) normally.

TIP:  Play (A) with the bottom three fingers, it'll make the slide up to (Bb) easier.

 
